<title>FINLAND: Finnish Oct jobless rate rises to 17.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Finnish Oct jobless rate rises to 17.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's jobless rate rose to 17.3 percent in October from 16.7 percent in September, the Labour Ministry said in its monthly employment survey on Thursday</p>
<p>			Oct 1996    Sept 1996	Oct 1995</p>
<p>    Unemployed     424,900     426,700	 448,300</p>
<p>    Jobless rate    17.3	  16.7	    18.3</p>
<p>The mean of six economists' forecasts for the September jobless rate measured by the labour ministry was 17.1 percent. The ministry's data is not used in international comparisons.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsrooom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
